  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "With **LEGIONES DAEMONICA** as your [Army Faction](vsdata:core-rule/select-army-faction), these parts of the battlefield lie in [your army's Shadow of Chaos](vsdata:ability/chaos-daemons.the-shadow-of-chaos):\n\n- your deployment zone, always\n- No Man's Land, for the rest of any phase that begins with you controlling half or more of the [objective markers](vsdata:core-rule/objectives) there\n- the deployment zone of your opponent, for the rest of any phase that begins with you controlling half or more of the objective markers there\n\n**DAEMONIC MANIFESTATION**: whenever a **LEGIONES DAEMONICA** unit of yours in your army's Shadow of Chaos rolls for [Battle-shock](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock), the roll gets +1. If it passes, one of the unit's models **heals** D3 wounds; for a **BATTLELINE** unit, as many as D3 **destroyed** models, not **CHARACTER** models, can return to it instead.\n\n**DAEMONIC TERROR**: whenever an enemy unit tests for Battle-shock while in your army's Shadow of Chaos, or while up to 6\" from any of your **BLOODTHIRSTER**, **SKARBRAND**, **LORD OF CHANGE**, **KAIROS FATEWEAVER**, **GREAT UNCLEAN ONE**, **ROTIGUS**, **KEEPER OF SECRETS** or **SHALAXI HELBANE** units, the test gets -1, and if it fails, the enemy unit takes D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds).",
    "citations": [
      {
